<div class="about-page">

  {%- comment -%} ── Hero Banner ── {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="about-hero">
    <img class="about-hero__image" src="{{ 'libersens-hero.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Libersens — made for private confidence" width="1792" height="900" loading="eager">
    <div class="about-hero__overlay"></div>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="about-hero__content">
        <p class="about-hero__eyebrow">About Libersens</p>
        <h1 class="about-hero__heading">Intimacy, reimagined<br>with intention.</h1>
        <p class="about-hero__sub">Private confidence, beautifully designed.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {%- comment -%} ── Mission ── {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="section about-mission">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="about-mission__inner">
        <p class="eyebrow">Our mission</p>
        <h2>We believe intimacy products should feel as considered as everything else you own.</h2>
        <p>Libersens is a product studio focused on one thing: making intimate wellness feel uncomplicated, private, and genuinely beautiful. We design for people who want quality without spectacle — products that sit quietly in your life, look good doing it, and work exactly as expected.</p>
        <p>Every detail, from the silicone finish to the packaging, is considered with discretion in mind. Because the best intimate product is one you never have to think twice about.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {%- comment -%} ── Image break ── {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="about-image-break">
    <img src="{{ 'libersens-lifestyle.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Libersens lifestyle" loading="lazy" width="1600" height="700">
  </div>

  {%- comment -%} ── Brand Values ── {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="section about-values">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading content-box--text-center" style="margin-bottom: 48px;">
        <p class="eyebrow">What we stand for</p>
        <h2>Four principles behind every decision we make.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="about-values__grid">
        <div class="about-value-card">
          <div class="about-value-card__number">01</div>
          <h3>Privacy as standard</h3>
          <p>Discreet packaging, plain charging cables, and a support team who treats every enquiry with respect. Privacy is not an add-on — it is the baseline.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="about-value-card">
          <div class="about-value-card__number">02</div>
          <h3>Body-safe, always</h3>
          <p>Every Libersens product is made from platinum-grade silicone — non-porous, hypoallergenic, and free from phthalates, BPA, and latex. No exceptions.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="about-value-card">
          <div class="about-value-card__number">03</div>
          <h3>Designed to be kept</h3>
          <p>We build products with longevity in mind. Durable materials, replaceable components where possible, and a care system that extends product life.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="about-value-card">
          <div class="about-value-card__number">04</div>
          <h3>Calm, honest communication</h3>
          <p>No clinical jargon, no sensationalism. Just honest product descriptions, clear guidance, and a tone that treats customers as adults.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {%- comment -%} ── Story split ── {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="about-story-split">
    <div class="about-story-split__media">
      <img src="{{ 'libersens-product-wearable.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Libersens She Bell wearable" loading="lazy" width="900" height="900">
    </div>
    <div class="about-story-split__content">
      <p class="eyebrow">The story</p>
      <h2>Built from a question we couldn't stop asking.</h2>
      <p>Libersens started with a frustration: why did intimate products look like medical devices or cheap novelties? Why was the packaging always either clinical or garish? Why did buying one feel like a transaction you had to hide?</p>
      <p>We set out to design a different category of product. One that looked like it belonged on your shelf, shipped like a subscription box, and worked with the kind of quiet reliability you expect from anything else you buy.</p>
      <p>The result is a small, considered range — built slowly, improved constantly, and designed around the person who buys it rather than the algorithm that shows it to them.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  {%- comment -%} ── Team ── {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="section about-team">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading content-box--text-center" style="margin-bottom: 40px;">
        <p class="eyebrow">The team</p>
        <h2>A small group of people who care about getting this right.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="about-team__grid">
        <div class="about-team-tile">
          <div class="about-team-tile__avatar">S</div>
          <h4>Sofia</h4>
          <p>Product Design</p>
        </div>
        <div class="about-team-tile">
          <div class="about-team-tile__avatar">M</div>
          <h4>Marcus</h4>
          <p>Brand &amp; Packaging</p>
        </div>
        <div class="about-team-tile">
          <div class="about-team-tile__avatar">J</div>
          <h4>Joanna</h4>
          <p>Customer Experience</p>
        </div>
        <div class="about-team-tile">
          <div class="about-team-tile__avatar">L</div>
          <h4>Lena</h4>
          <p>Product Development</p>
        </div>
        <div class="about-team-tile">
          <div class="about-team-tile__avatar">R</div>
          <h4>Rafael</h4>
          <p>Operations</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {%- comment -%} ── Stat strip ── {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="about-stats">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="about-stats__grid">
        <div class="about-stat">
          <span class="about-stat__number">100%</span>
          <span class="about-stat__label">Body-safe platinum silicone</span>
        </div>
        <div class="about-stat">
          <span class="about-stat__number">3</span>
          <span class="about-stat__label">Product families, thoughtfully grown</span>
        </div>
        <div class="about-stat">
          <span class="about-stat__number">Plain</span>
          <span class="about-stat__label">Packaging on every single order</span>
        </div>
        <div class="about-stat">
          <span class="about-stat__number">1 day</span>
          <span class="about-stat__label">Average support response time</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</div>

